te":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-03-05T21:59:37Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T21:57:45Z","closed_at":"2025-03-12T21:57:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.2.beta5.official [4c96e9676], v4.2.beta6.official [64150060f], v4.2.rc1.official [ad72de508], 4.2 stable, 4.3 stable and 4.4 stable\nNot reproducible in: 4.0 stable, 4.1 stable, 4.1.4 stable, v4.2 dev1, v4.2.beta1.official [b1371806a], v4.2.beta4.official [93cdacbb0]\n\nI got a little carried away in finding the version where the bug first appeared. Apologies for not including the commit hash in some of the versions (though they were all official builds so I probably didn't need to)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.4633) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11800H @ 2.30GHz (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen pasting from clipboard a node with children to a scene without a root node, the children appear visually but don't appear to be children of the root node. If the project is closed and reopened the texture of the child will no longer appear\n\nThis image shows the issue, as the Sprite2D that should've been pasted as a child of the root node isn't there but the texture can be seen (the texture can't be interacted with, though it can be moved if you move the root node)\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb21de9d-6998-4140-8f29-40ec6ef3d00d)\n\nThis issue doesn't happen when pasting a root node with children.\n\nps: I am very new to Godot so I don't know if this (the children not being copied to the root node) is intended or not but I'm pretty sure that the Sprite2D texture isn't supposed to appear while not existing\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1) Open the node2D.tscn\n2) Copy the Node2D named 'copy_me'\n3) Add a new scene\n4) Click \"Paste from clipboard\" (or Ctrl+V)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP: [godot-issue-with-clipboard-pasting_2025-03-05_22-46-52.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19097199/godot-issue-with-clipboard-pasting_2025-03-05_22-46-52.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_i